At this point they can be nice for:
1) Bypass most of Rodney's tower (once you're in it, levelport to the
top level)
2) Get to the bottom level of Gehennom after getting the book from
Rodney
3) Levelport down into the sanctum to avoid most of the level
(assuming you have cursed !gain level to get back out).

Skipping those things is something I always do; it's nice to have done
things the "hard" way just to have done it, but it gets boring after a
while--in your case, with time limited, I'd recommend skipping and
fight through everything the second time.

But it's not essential.  And you can't levelport with the Amulet, so
they won't help post-Sanctum (barring bizarre circumstances that
warrant ditching the amulet and airlifting to safety).


